# The per-story gate: does the tree still build? One command per line; stops at
# the first failure. Weave runs this on every story merge, so it stays fast.
#
# Operator rule 2026-11-21: long-running and judge tests (go test ./..., the
# sealed Bash 5.3 86/86 gate, 3-OS e2e) do NOT run per story. Stories add their
# own targeted tests; the full run happens ONCE at sprint end / release from
# .bashy/gate.final, on the gate host in the official image.
"${BASHY:-bashy}" dag build
